1
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:09,230
♪La la la la la la, la la la la la la♪

2
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,740
♪La la la la la la la la la♪

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:16,329
♪No matter what day it is,
I'll spend it with you♪

4
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:19,100
♪We're more sure
of each other than ever♪

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,060
=Watching Heart Signal with You=

6
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,180
(Before recording)

7
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,720
Have a seat.

8
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:28,880
This is the photo we took last time.

9
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,720
Yeah, every time we finish
filming the watch-along,

10
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:31,600
we all take a photo together.

11
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,520
After filming?

12
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,040
We can take one now if you want.

13
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,080
We can't put it up yet.

14
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,040
Then let's take it after filming.

15
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:36,960
Yeah, after filming.

16
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,600
So, are you excited?

17
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,320
Pretty excited.

18
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,600
Cui Yihang isn't usually like this.

19
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:45,320
Isn't Cui Yihang usually pretty talkative?

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:48,040
(Loading)
My brain's working. Yeah.

21
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,320
How's everyone been keeping up?

22
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,720
I'm watching as soon as it drops.

23
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:55,080
I watch every afternoon
when the new episode comes out.

24
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,800
So do you watch it smiling, or...

25
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,920
(Me)
I... I can't even watch.

26
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,160
I need a "shield" to watch it.

27
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:06,240
You know, Cao Yiheng is really charming
when he smiles.

28
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,880
His smile isn't like
our normal toothy smile. It's like...

29
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:13,240
A sunflower,
always facing his little sun.

30
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,040
You're never this talkative around us.

31
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:17,360
So shy.

32
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:18,880
Should I face you guys too?

33
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,560
Watching you two,

34
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,640
I was actually a little jealous.

35
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:26,160
You know I'm pretty possessive.

36
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,000
Who do you want to "possess"?

37
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,920
I want to "possess" every one of you.

38
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,920
Can I look him in the eyes when I talk?

39
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:40,560
No. Look me in the eyes.

40
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,240
Honestly, I just want

41
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,480
to sneak glances
from far away, you know?

42
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,520
When you walked out after seeing that,

43
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,760
you bumped into that chair by the door.

44
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,760
Did you even feel it hurt?

45
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,880
I was too worked up.

46
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,680
I honestly didn't think

47
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,440
about how those two felt.

48
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,320
I've reflected on it anyway.

49
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,120
It's okay. Everyone knows you.

50
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,080
You're really not that kind of person.

51
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,080
Yeah, you're just pretty

52
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:05,840
simple.

53
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,720
Very straightforward.

54
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,880
He's not the type to hide how he feels.

55
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,199
Yeah, he's straightforward.

56
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:13,720
All right, now

57
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,960
let's introduce ourselves.

58
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,480
Let's start with Cui Yihang.

59
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:20,280
(Cui Yihang)
Hi, I'm Cui Yihang from Heart Signal 9.

60
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:23,120
(Cao Yiheng)
Hi, I'm Cao Yiheng from Heart Signal 9.

61
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,880
(Sun Bohan)
Hi, I'm Sun Bohan from Heart Signal 9.

62
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,760
(Zhao Xilun)
Hi, I'm Zhao Xilun from Heart Signal 9.

63
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,040
So...

64
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:32,560
Shall we start?

65
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:32,960
Let's start.

66
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,440
Let's do it.

67
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:38,000
Put on your earphones.

68
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,080
Just one side is fine.

69
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,560
I'm suddenly a little nervous.

70
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,000
Take a sip if you're nervous.

71
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:47,280
Seriously, my heart just started racing.

72
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,160
Two channels.

73
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,120
It's mainly because every time we watch,

74
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,880
we don't know what's coming.

75
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:51,240
Right.

76
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,160
Right.

77
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,360
I'm back.

78
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,640
(Hi)
Who's that?

79
00:02:58,900 --> 00:02:59,900
What'd you get?

80
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:01,370
Hot pot.

81
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:02,960
I got some stuff for hot pot.

82
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,970
(We're all done)
That was hot pot day.

83
00:03:03,970 --> 00:03:04,620
You're all done?

84
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:05,720
It's fine.

85
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:06,840
We can eat it for days.

86
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,600
(Following)
Look, you and Cui Kaiyi always

87
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,200
wear the same color palette, Cao Yiheng.

88
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,840
Life in the house was honestly so happy.

89
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,200
Every day felt like a holiday.

90
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:16,960
Yeah.

91
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,040
We ate so well every day.

92
00:03:18,710 --> 00:03:19,380
Hey, guys.

93
00:03:19,990 --> 00:03:20,700
Who's here?

94
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:22,540
(Zhao Xilun returns to the Signal House)
I'm back.

95
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,440
(Hi)
Zhao Xilun's back.

96
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:24,880
Sporty guy.

97
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,750
I got everyone some snacks.

98
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,760
Every time Zhao Xilun comes back,

99
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,160
he's full of energy.

100
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,640
It's like he comes in
with a gust of wind.

101
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,200
You know?

102
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,680
(I really wanted some ice cream)
You two had the same vibe that day.

103
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,410
(Perfect. Should I freeze it first?)
Me and who?

104
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:33,800
Sun Bohan.

105
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,440
Same hairstyle
and same style of clothes.

106
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:38,200
Because we'd planned it the day before.

107
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,600
We both decided to slick our hair back.

108
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,080
Yeah.

109
00:03:41,650 --> 00:03:43,840
Hey, you guys already started eating?

110
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:47,620
What'd you bring?

111
00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:48,400
Can this go in the fridge?

112
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,330
(Takes it)
What'd you bring, Xing?

113
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:51,700
This 125-gram pack of blueberries.

114
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,000
(Wu Xingying brings back blueberries)
You might need to take a few out.

115
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,920
So the next day,
Xing brought blueberries.

116
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,680
Yeah.

117
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:57,880
Your 100 grams.

118
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,080
And Xing's 25 grams.

119
00:03:59,080 --> 00:03:59,480
Yeah.

120
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,480
But I was kinda...

121
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,400
slow on the uptake.
I didn't realize it then.

122
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,320
It hit me later.

123
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,320
And I was really touched.

124
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,600
Don't be so oblivious next time.

125
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:12,260
My head...

126
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:14,310
My head looks kinda big, right?

127
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:14,980
If you don't mind,

128
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:15,570
I'll fix it for you a little.

129
00:04:15,570 --> 00:04:16,180
It's fine.

130
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:16,579
(Helping)

131
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,360
He's blushing.

132
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,040
If you don't mind.

133
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,890
Okay, thanks.

134
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:22,840
Can't help it. I'm shy.

135
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,400
But look at those two.

136
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,240
You can tell Xing's secretly smiling.

137
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,680
(Two glasses of water)
She's smiling on the inside.

138
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,120
Si's just smiling normally.

139
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,810
Thanks.

140
00:04:35,290 --> 00:04:36,000
(Cui Yihang)
Hi.

141
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:36,410
Hi.

142
00:04:36,410 --> 00:04:37,260
Hey, you're back.

143
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:38,030
(Greeting)
Hi.

144
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,080
Who's back?

145
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,480
Cui Yihang, the one Si's watching.

146
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,760
Cui Yihang, have you eaten?

147
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:42,280
No.

148
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:42,540
A little.

149
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,640
Why is Si the one watching Cui Yihang?

150
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:48,260
(Moves it)

151
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,320
She moved it for you.

152
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,600
(Glances)
She saved you a seat.

153
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,800
She wanted me to sit there.

154
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:56,480
(Getting closer)
Cui Yihang looks like he's washing dishes.

155
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,140
But you're really looking
for a spot to join them.

156
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:58,460
Sit.

157
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,280
Cui Yihang notices everything.

158
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,520
A little.

159
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,240
(Cui Yihang sits beside Wu Siying)
And you just casually sat right there.

160
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,560
Right, Cui Yihang?

161
00:05:08,710 --> 00:05:10,230
It's okay. I've already picked

162
00:05:10,230 --> 00:05:11,110
two dishes.

163
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,770
When are you making them?

164
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,400
Tomorrow.

165
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:15,850
Okay.

166
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:18,040
(Laughs)
Why do you keep laughing?

167
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,240
This was from that bet Cui Yihang made.

168
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,120
You lost the bet, right?

169
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,440
Yeah, we made a bet, and then

170
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,840
you guessed it'd be a guy.

171
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:24,440
I said a guy.

172
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,160
She said a girl.

173
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:26,120
I remember.

174
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,960
We originally said five dishes.

175
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,600
Then she said we could cut two.

176
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:29,960
She was worried
I couldn't make that many.

177
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,600
I'd have to force it.

178
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,360
Si really looks out for you.

179
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:34,800
It's fine. Let's start another table.

180
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,330
Then let's go over there.

181
00:05:36,330 --> 00:05:37,540
(Gets up)
We got here later anyway.

182
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,370
It's fine.

183
00:05:38,690 --> 00:05:40,000
But your bowls

184
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,360
and chopsticks are already here.

185
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,160
You really didn't want Xing to leave.

186
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,280
(Thinking)
You wouldn't let her go.

187
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,560
Xing's about to go over there.

188
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,760
You were crushed inside.

189
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,680
But you're saying it's fine.

190
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,520
It was written all over your face.

191
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,080
Yeah. I'm not great
at expressing myself.

192
00:05:51,450 --> 00:05:51,800
Pick

193
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,410
the most unexpected pair.

194
00:05:52,410 --> 00:05:53,360
Let those two try.

195
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,800
Come on.

196
00:05:55,490 --> 00:05:56,130
Me?

197
00:05:56,130 --> 00:05:56,470
Yeah.

198
00:05:56,950 --> 00:05:57,550
Me and who?

199
00:05:59,520 --> 00:05:59,950
This is...

200
00:06:04,230 --> 00:06:04,730
I was just saying.

201
00:06:04,730 --> 00:06:05,260
Never mind.

202
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:05,720
Forget it.

203
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,400
I realized Cui Yihang
is actually the most surprising.

204
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:11,640
Yeah.

205
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:12,720
The second everyone looks at you,

206
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,560
you get super shy.

207
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,720
I turned around and there were

208
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,120
one, two, three, four...

209
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,080
Eight pairs of eyes.

210
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,320
I couldn't say it.

211
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,000
You turned this way,

212
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,880
saw everyone staring at you,

213
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,680
then turned right back.

214
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:19,920
Yeah.

215
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,720
I didn't dare

216
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,360
say it anymore.

217
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,560
Cui Yihang is hilarious.

218
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:23,920
But I think

219
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,820
the ones harder to crack than us

220
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:25,660
are Si and Xing.

221
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:26,500
Those two usually won't laugh.

222
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:26,790
You know?

223
00:06:26,790 --> 00:06:27,210
Like...

224
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:29,060
Anyway, Xing and Si

225
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:30,160
definitely have to be split up.

226
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:31,060
Okay.

227
00:06:32,090 --> 00:06:32,610
Pick someone else.

228
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:33,520
Chen Hewen.

229
00:06:34,130 --> 00:06:35,290
I'm on your team now, right?

230
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,880
How did you pick
your teammates back then?

231
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:38,760
I was thinking

232
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:41,160
it'd make things more fun for everyone

233
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,280
and keep the teams more balanced.

234
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,320
Yeah.

235
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,360
I actually wanted Chen Hewen on your team.

236
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,240
Chen Hewen and me?

237
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,040
Because you said you've got "rizz".

238
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:48,920
And I suspected

239
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,840
Chen Hewen's got some "rizz" too.

240
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,240
So I wanted you two together.

241
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,880
Wouldn't those two be unbeatable?

242
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,520
And I was supposed
to be on that team too.

243
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,720
The three of us together.

244
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,840
"Rizz No. 1, No. 2, and No. 3".

245
00:06:58,590 --> 00:06:59,000
I'm counting on you.

246
00:06:59,000 --> 00:06:59,980
I'll go first.

247
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:01,310
Okay, let's go.

248
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:02,100
Who's next?

249
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:03,830
Come on, Chen Hewen.

250
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,040
(You got this)
Why did I put you two together?

251
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,680
I'm screwed.

252
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,440
(I'm kinda screwed)
Why?

253
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,280
(Right now...)
The second I saw Chen Hewen's face,

254
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,680
before he'd even gone up,

255
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,840
just thinking about what he
was gonna say

256
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:12,680
made him want to laugh.

257
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,120
(Sits up straight)
That's why I couldn't look at him.

258
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,000
Look, even his ears are red.

259
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,200
He hadn't even said anything yet.

260
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:18,960
He just rehearsed it in his head,

261
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,640
and his ears were already red.

262
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,000
Okay, start.

263
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,440
Yeah.

264
00:07:20,810 --> 00:07:22,130
How's your love life lately?

265
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,880
How's your love life lately?

266
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:27,120
Right where it hurts for Chen Hewen.

267
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:28,720
Cui Kaiyi came prepared too.

268
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,480
She's got "ammo".

269
00:07:30,650 --> 00:07:31,580
Probably not as good as yours.

270
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,320
Well...

271
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,040
Look at that little smirk.

272
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,280
Of course not, he thought.

273
00:07:40,780 --> 00:07:41,800
Why do you

274
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,670
have so many

275
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:43,390
mosquito bites on your arm?

276
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,820
(He-"wen")
Because he's He-"wen".

277
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,200
He-"wen".
[*Mosquito]

278
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,640
