300
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:25,920
Yeah.

301
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,680
So intense.

302
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,520
I finally understood Cui Kaiyi's

303
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,960
