324
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:04,960
Yeah.

325
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:07,000
If we played again now,

326
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,800
I might not lose.

327
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:09,760
I might not win.

328
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,440
We know everyone's weaknesses now.

329
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,840
Yeah, we know each other better now.

330
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:13,960
Yeah.

331
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:16,870
Whenever you're next to me,

332
00:09:16,870 --> 00:09:17,790
