598
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,480
Yeah, it's kind of like game theory.

599
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:34,840
Yeah.

600
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:36,240
The three of you...

601
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,720
You and Sha Yue'er,
and Chen Hewen and Sha Yue'er,

