645
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,800
You don't know where to look.

646
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:48,560
I don't know who to greet.

647
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:50,000
Like, who do I look at

648
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:50,200
Yeah.

649
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:50,920
