650
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:54,360
Yeah. I get a little socially awkward.

651
00:17:57,360 --> 00:17:57,980
Last night,

652
00:17:57,980 --> 00:17:58,700
where did you go?

653
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:00,980
(Chokes)

654
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:01,680
(Last night)
It feels like

655
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,840
(Earlier with)
