690
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:03,840
Alright, let's keep going.

691
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:04,360
Let's continue.

692
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,160
Keep going.

693
00:19:05,370 --> 00:19:06,920
