736
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,000
It just came from the heart.

737
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:14,560
Yeah, it just

738
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,480
came from the heart.

739
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,280
That was really sincere.

740
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,160
Straight from the heart.

741
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:19,040
I'm actually pretty bad with words.

742
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,240
I don't really know
how to say romantic things.

743
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,880
But in that moment,

744
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,040
it really just

745
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,600
