748
00:20:30,780 --> 00:20:32,260
"Flowing water doesn't
rush to be first."

749
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:33,370
"It keeps flowing endlessly"?

750
00:20:33,630 --> 00:20:35,370
When the current starts off too strong,

751
00:20:35,370 --> 00:20:35,860
