763
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,880
I cry way too easily.

764
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:04,600
No.

765
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:05,680
That's totally normal.

766
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:06,920
It's just

767
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:09,120
this part of their story
really moves people.

768
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:09,920
It really does.

769
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:12,600
I didn't know you two
