775
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:26,480
I just feel really lucky.

776
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:29,560
When we were rowing,

777
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:31,400
time felt like it flew by.

778
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:33,240
Everything felt so natural and relaxed.

779
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,120
That was honestly the first time

780
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:37,400
I completely let my guard down.

781
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:41,080
I just hadn't
seen that scene in so long.

782
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:42,840
Seeing it again suddenly felt like

783
00:21:42,840 --> 00:21:45,280
