784
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:48,560
It really felt
like getting hit by a star.

785
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,520
Look, I'm getting emotional about it.

786
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,400
It's okay. Keep watching.

787
00:21:52,800 --> 00:21:54,080
I just hate watching myself.

788
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:55,600
I can't handle seeing myself on screen.

789
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:56,720
It's okay.

790
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:00,490
I think the city date

791
00:22:00,490 --> 00:22:02,490
