797
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,160
Is she...

798
00:22:10,310 --> 00:22:10,830
Oh my God.

799
00:22:10,830 --> 00:22:12,650
This guy's way too lucky.

800
00:22:12,980 --> 00:22:13,900
("Lucky Guy")

801
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:17,560
Lucky Guy.

802
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,800
Fools have all the luck.

803
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,800
She is so cool.

804
00:22:34,280 --> 00:22:35,010
So cool.

805
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:36,420
Yeah.

806
00:22:36,420 --> 00:22:37,300
(Wu Xingying starts her first city date)

807
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:46,800
I really regretted it then. I thought,

808
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:49,600
I should've been brave and voted first.

809
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:50,920
I didn't think I should let her

810
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:53,280
