814
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,000
Yeah, but she's actually even slower
to warm up than me.

815
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:04,360
Yeah.

816
00:23:04,360 --> 00:23:07,160
Yet she was braver
than me and voted first.

817
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:08,800
She's helping you become better.

818
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:09,960
Yeah.

819
00:23:15,030 --> 00:23:16,020
Do you know which room

820
00:23:16,020 --> 00:23:16,850
