821
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:19,700
(Over there)
The room all the way inside?

822
00:23:20,730 --> 00:23:21,160
Okay.

823
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:21,800
Asking for directions.

824
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:22,600
I'll call him for you.

825
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:30,360
I got it instantly.

826
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:32,080
I knew right away.

827
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:33,200
A few seconds later, I backed off.

828
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:33,760
